  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>P</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math> &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>where</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>P</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>6</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">